{
 "id": "fox-whiff-punish",
 "name": "Whiff punish",
 "part": "neutral",
 "characters": [
  "fox"
 ],
 "goal": "Make an attack miss, then grab it before it can act",
 "why": "An attack that misses leaves its user in its recovery, unable to act. Coming in to the edge of its range draws it out; out of reach as it swings, Fox dashes in and grabs before it recovers. Smashes and slow tilts leave the most time.",
 "switch": "success",
 "tutorial": {
  "what": "Come in to the edge of its range. When it attacks, dash back out; once its hitbox is gone, dash in and grab: X or Y, then Z in the jump squat.",
  "expect": "Each attack is judged when your grab or hit lands, when you are hit, or when it can act again: whether it missed, and whether the punish came in time. The opponents attack with {attacks}.",
  "example": [
   {
    "stick": [
     0.5,
     0
    ],
    "frame": 20,
    "hold": 400
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     -1,
     0
    ],
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": 6,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     0
    ],
    "frame": 7,
    "hold": 200,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     1,
     0
    ],
    "frame": "GO",
    "hold": 200,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "press": "jump",
    "frame": 1,
    "from": {
     "near": 16,
     "after": {
      "frame": "GO"
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "press": "Z",
    "frame": 2,
    "from": {
     "near": 16,
     "after": {
      "frame": "GO"
     }
    }
   }
  ],
  "marks": {
   "1": "Frame 1: its attack starts. Dash back out",
   "7": "Frame {f}: out of its range",
   "GO": "Frame {GO}: its hitbox is gone. Dash in"
  },
  "lessons": [
   {
    "title": "Whiff punishing",
    "text": [
     "An opponent attacks when it sees you come close, about a quarter of a second after you do. Stop at the edge of its range or dash back out as it starts, and the attack misses.",
     "Its recovery follows: frames in which it cannot act. Dash in once its hitbox is gone; within reach, press X or Y, then Z in the jump squat. The jump-cancelled grab catches it before it can act."
    ],
    "scenario": 1,
    "show": {
